against that tree; lane B owns src/Legality/Gen4Legality.cpp and should adapt the hunk to its
own branch. Build lists: tests/test_legality_gen4 already links Gen3Legality.cpp and
Gen3LegalityDataCxd.cpp through GEN3_LEGALITY_CONTEXT_SOURCES (Makefile.host.base), so no
Makefile change is needed for Gen IV. Title-matrix rows affected once wired:
tests/test_legality_title_matrix.cpp:1775-1787 (Pal Park Colosseum Umbreon / Shadow Quilava
expect the "not verified" Warning today).

What the judge does and does not cover is in include/Legality/Gen3Cxd.h (contract) and
docs/legality/GEN3_PKHEX_RULE_INVENTORY.md section 7.

